[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401476942","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111025#issuecomment-3401476942","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111025","id":3401476942,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KvmtO","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T12:10:41Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T12:10:41Z","body":"Is it possible to achieve the same without saving and reloading scene? If the scene is not saved, you can \"undo\" the change by reloading the scene, which is useful option.\r\n\r\nYou can clear scene's undo history and it will mark the scene as unsaved with no way of undo. Not sure about other problems, but it should be possible to fix them too.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401476942/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401753043","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111025#issuecomment-3401753043","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111025","id":3401753043,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KwqHT","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T13:15:06Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T13:15:06Z","body":"> Is it possible to achieve the same without saving and reloading scene? If the scene is not saved, you can \"undo\" the change by reloading the scene, which is useful option.\r\n\r\nI can give it a try, but recreating the entire hierarchy, as reloading it from a file, would need lots of works.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401753043/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401841945","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111025#issuecomment-3401841945","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111025","id":3401841945,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Kw_0Z","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T13:25:33Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T13:25:33Z","body":"I think the problem is that `update_tree()` does not take effect for some reason (or it's updated wrong). The fix might be simply forcing a refresh. It should be possible without reload, and without lots of changes.\r\n\r\nFor a hacky solution, calling `scene_tree->set_valid_types({})` will force full tree update, but I think a dedicated method would be better.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401841945/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3402078698","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111025#issuecomment-3402078698","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111025","id":3402078698,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Kx5nq","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T14:09:20Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T14:39:24Z","body":"> I think the problem is that `update_tree()` does not take effect for some reason (or it's updated wrong). The fix might be simply forcing a refresh. It should be possible without reload, and without lots of changes.\r\n\r\nIn my investigation, the \"Clear Inheritance\" operation is not complete. It only clean `inheritated_state` and emit an event, without clear all of it's children state. So after `update_tree`, we still get the old children's state.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e825169957e4ec67bc0baa6168af02b337399f6f/scene/main/node.cpp#L2809-L2813\r\n\r\nAnd before \"Clear Inheritance\", there is only one node with a reference for an \"ext_resource\".\r\n\r\n```\r\n[ext_resource type=\"PackedScene\" uid=\"uid://bowuloxmdkrly\" path=\"res://prefab.tscn\" id=\"1_by10c\"]\r\n[node name=\"PrefabChildToTest\" instance=ExtResource(\"1_by10c\")]\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter \"Clear Inheritance\", we need create the real tree structure for the new scene.\r\n\r\n```\r\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" uid=\"uid://cdao4baykx3v\" path=\"res://prefab.gd\" id=\"1_3o2mv\"]\r\n[node name=\"PrefabChildToTest\" type=\"Node2D\"]\r\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_3o2mv\")\r\n[node name=\"Node2D\" type=\"Node2D\" parent=\".\"]\r\n[connection signal=\"draw\" from=\"Node2D\" to=\".\" method=\"_on_node_2d_draw\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\nI agree the current PR is not so good. I can do more digging to find a better solution.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Edit:**\r\n\r\n`scene_tree->set_valid_types({})` can resolve the left menu tree warning, but signal warning on Inspector is still.\r\nI will keep digging.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3402078698/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3417862697","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111025#issuecomment-3417862697","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111025","id":3417862697,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LuHIp","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-18T06:14:27Z","updated_at":"2025-10-18T07:12:54Z","body":"@KoBeWi \r\n\r\nI found `check_and_update_scene()` supports reload scene from memory. Please take a look when you have time.\r\n\r\nBTW: There is a compilation error on windows platform. Looks like ret_nodes maybe unintiliazed on some situations. I don't know how to fix it, yet.\r\n\r\n```\r\nscene\\resources\\packed_scene.cpp:702:27: error: '*ret_nodes' may be used uninitialized [-Werror=maybe-uninitialized]\r\n  702 |         return ret_nodes[0];\r\n```\r\n\r\nMaybe related this: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111771","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3417862697/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3463040622","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111025#issuecomment-3463040622","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111025","id":3463040622,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Oac5u","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-29T18:22:03Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T18:22:03Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3463040622/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]